Linear stores bold text that holds inline code as bold runs around the code, together with its other list and whitespace rewrites; `**` inside a code span, also one across lines, stays literal. A protected update verifies that read-back and reports the normalized description; an edit by someone else right after the write still fails verification.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000123", "identifier": "ENG-123", "title": "Verified", "description": "Before"}]}
-- run --
linear issue view ENG-123 --json > original.json
-- file desired.md --
- 范围
- **黑名单（`2015`）**
- 写法 ``**a `b` c**``

示例 ``开始
**a `b` c**
结束``
-- run --
linear issue update ENG-123 --description-file desired.md --base-file original.json --json
-- stdout.json --
{
  "ok": true,
  "effect": "applied",
  "data": {"...": true},
  "fields": [
    {
      "field": "description",
      "inputField": "description",
      "base": "Before",
      "desired": "- 范围\n- **黑名单（`2015`）**\n- 写法 ``**a `b` c**``\n\n示例 ``开始\n**a `b` c**\n结束``\n",
      "remote": "Before",
      "verdict": "write"
    }
  ],
  "verification": {
    "scope": "issue-fields",
    "status": "verified",
    "normalizedFields": [
      "description"
    ]
  },
  "readBack": {
    "organization": {"...": true},
    "issue": {
      "...": true,
      "description": "* 范围\n* **黑名单（**`2015`**）**\n* 写法 ``**a `b` c**``\n\n示例 ``开始\n**a `b` c**\n结束``"
    }
  }
}
-- mutations.json --
{"issueUpdate": 1}
-- state.json --
{"Issue": [{"identifier": "ENG-123", "description": "* 范围\n* **黑名单（**`2015`**）**\n* 写法 ``**a `b` c**``\n\n示例 ``开始\n**a `b` c**\n结束``"}]}
-- run --
linear issue view ENG-123 --json > second.json
-- file desired2.md --
**对 `2015` 生效**
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "mutation:issueUpdate", "action": "patch-after", "seed": {"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000123", "description": "**对** `2016` **生效**"}]}}]
-- run --
linear issue update ENG-123 --description-file desired2.md --base-file second.json --json
-- stdout.json --
{
  "ok": false,
  "effect": "applied",
  "data": {"...": true},
  "error": {
    "code": "WriteError",
    "message": "Failed to update issue: Issue mutation succeeded but read-back did not verify",
    "suggestion": "Read the issue before continuing; do not repeat the mutation.",
    "details": {
      "verification": {
        "scope": "issue-fields",
        "status": "different",
        "fields": [
          "description"
        ]
      },
      "readBack": {
        "organization": {"...": true},
        "issue": {
          "...": true,
          "description": "**对** `2016` **生效**"
        }
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "description",
          "inputField": "description",
          "base": "* 范围\n* **黑名单（**`2015`**）**\n* 写法 ``**a `b` c**``\n\n示例 ``开始\n**a `b` c**\n结束``",
          "desired": "**对 `2015` 生效**\n",
          "remote": "* 范围\n* **黑名单（**`2015`**）**\n* 写法 ``**a `b` c**``\n\n示例 ``开始\n**a `b` c**\n结束``",
          "verdict": "write"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
-- exit --
1
-- mutations.json --
{"issueUpdate": 1}
